This app's solar-position math (sunrise/sunset/twilight/equation of time/
sun position) is a C port of the astronomical algorithms from:

    SolarCalculator Library for Arduino
    https://github.com/jpb10/SolarCalculator
    Copyright (c) 2021 jpb10
    Licensed under the MIT License

Most formulas are taken from Astronomical Algorithms by Jean Meeus
(2nd ed., Willmann-Bell, 1998), as implemented by the above library.

This app's moon-phase math (illuminated fraction, moon age, next new/full
moon) is a C port of the algorithms from:

    moonPhase-esp32
    https://github.com/CelliesProjects/moonPhase-esp32
    Copyright (c) 2018 Cellie (Marcel Timmer)
    Licensed under the MIT License

That library is itself adapted from http://www.voidware.com/phase.c.

The on-screen QR code is generated with:

    QR Code generator library (C)
    https://github.com/nayuki/QR-Code-generator
    Copyright (c) Project Nayuki
